### List coupons
GET http://localhost:5000/api/coupons?page=1&limit=10

### Search coupons
GET http://localhost:5000/api/coupons?q=DK100

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/coupons/coupons-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FIRSTSHOW",
  "discountPct": 15,
  "maxDiscount": 249,
  "active": true
}
